  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ravi Kant Shukla vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 26 August, 2019 Bench: Shashi Kant Gupta, Umesh Kumar High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 32 Case :- Writ - C No. - 27381 of 2019 Petitioner :- Ravi Kant Shukla Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others",
    "facts": "This writ petition, has been filed, inter alia, for the following relief: \" Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of certiorari quashing the notice dated 16.07.2019 u/s. 46(4) of Food safety and Standards Act issued by respondent no. 3 (Annexure No. 1).\" From perusal of the record, it transpires that an inspection of the restaurant of the petitioner was made on 23.6.2019 and after inquiry a notice dated 16.7.2019 was issued to him along with the Ravi Kant Shukla vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 26 August, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/32055094/ 1 report of the food analyst dated 10.7.2019 but a copy of the inquiry report has not been annexed with the writ petition. On a query being made to the learned counsel for the petitioner for producing a copy of the said report, he expressed his inability to produce the same before the court.",
